:====
# Settling resolves authored priority (inline beats rule, later rule beats earlier), @inherited
# properties default to the parent's computed value (the initializer is the root fallback),
# explicit inherit overrides a lower-priority concrete declaration, and changed declared
# properties raise persistent per-node domain bits summarized in the root's pending counts.

