# Raising a domain bit on a deep node marks the conservative descendant rollup on every ancestor,
# read through $is-<domain>-invalid-below. Clearing the node's own bit leaves rollups alone (phase
# walks clear them after visiting), and untouched sibling subtrees stay clean throughout.

